    "Revision 2 (2026-09-16, branch ticket/CMP-03-r2, Devin review notes 13 and 15): teaching example with i on both sides, header C / C++ / C# / Java, motion transform into the real Rank loop held at the end. Revision-1 release approval does not carry over; release unreviewed.",
